  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">University commitment to social change in El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is framed in the Institutional Strategic Plan of UCA (PEI 2021-2025), specifically in its Proposal 4 related to Social Outreach, which seeks to strengthen the capacity of the UCA to influence reality, proposing public policies and solutions to national and regional problems that most affect the population. The partner will coordinate and generate synergies with different actors -internal and external- according in order to increase citizen awareness, to monitor, analyse and communicate the national reality and its challenges related to democracy, human rights and sustainable human development.</narrative>
  </description>
